WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:04.310
Over the last few years, many people have changed careers

2
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:07.460
and reevaluated that work life balance,

3
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:08.880
what it looks like to them.

4
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.240
And now companies are responding.

5
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.260
Okay, this story blew my mind.

6
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.610
And this is now my favorite company.

7
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.650
Listen to this.

8
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.650
CNBC reports a tech company called Seven Rooms

9
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:25.520
is offering incredible incentives to their employees.

10
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.880
For new hires, they offer two fully paid weeks off

11
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.900 line:15%
before they even start.

12
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.830 line:15%
That's two free weeks at full pay to do whatever they want.

13
00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.850 line:15%
And that's not all.

14
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.670 line:15%
All employees must take five consecutive days off

15
00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.260 line:15%
at least twice a year.

16
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.750 line:15%
And longtime employees must double that

17
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.869 line:15%
by taking 10 consecutive days off twice a year

18
00:00:47.869 --> 00:00:48.702 line:15%
Wow.

19
00:00:48.702 --> 00:00:49.719 line:15%
Thoughts?

20
00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:51.969 line:15%
(applause)

21
00:00:55.723 --> 00:00:57.140 line:15%
Are you hiring?

22
00:00:58.190 --> 00:00:59.340 line:15%
I'm not going anywhere,

23
00:01:01.275 --> 00:01:02.930 line:15%
but that tells people who wanna work at this company

24
00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.283
right away, we value you.

25
00:01:05.283 --> 00:01:06.940
We value you.

26
00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.520
And as an employee, that is so important

27
00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:11.650
and so different to hear.

28
00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:14.160
This story really took my breath away.

29
00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.920
And I just think Seven Rooms, let this work.

30
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.170
You could be the origin story to a new model

31
00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:27.170
where we allow people a life and we reward them for it.

32
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.032
(applause)

33
00:01:30.032 --> 00:01:32.710
And we feed their soul and interests.

34
00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:35.510
And we give them things to look forward to

35
00:01:36.449 --> 00:01:37.410
and plans to make

36
00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.980
and take some of the financial burden out of it.

37
00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:44.980
And I wonder if it will bring more focus and passion

38
00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:51.370
in their job because they feel respected and incentivized.

39
00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.410
Also, I just love this tone.

40
00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.130
This is like, we value you.

41
00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.630
From the get go.

42
00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.463
I love it.

43
00:01:58.463 --> 00:01:59.296
(applause)

44
00:01:59.296 --> 00:02:01.700
I hope this is a success

45
00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.048
and the first of many to follow.

46
00:02:04.048 --> 00:02:06.631
(upbeat music)

